urem3: x % 3, for x from 0 to 999. Inline: no call.
Listed at cells 10-24, with x in cell 90 and a scratch cell t0 in cell 91.
Copy cells 10-24 to where the program needs x % 3, with each 90 changed to the program's cell for x and each 91 to a free cell; the program goes on with x % 3 in the accumulator.
It overwrites the accumulator and t0; x is kept.
Size 16 cells (15 instructions and t0). It runs 15 instructions, straight through.
Exact over the domain.

cell  contents   notes
 10     190      CLA 90   cells 10-20: s = x + 1; v = 333s modulo 1000 (each STO keeps three digits); right for x >= 0 only
 11     200      ADD 00
 12     691      STO 91
 13     410      SFT 10
 14     291      ADD 91
 15     410      SFT 10
 16     291      ADD 91
 17     691      STO 91
 18     291      ADD 91
 19     291      ADD 91
 20     691      STO 91
 21     191      CLA 91   cells 21-24: 3v / 1000
 22     291      ADD 91
 23     291      ADD 91
 24     403      SFT 03
 90     000      data: x, the program's cell, which is kept
 91     000      data: t0, scratch
